  "notes": "播放内核全面更新。\n\n- 更新所有平台的视频、音频、字幕与安全连接组件。\n- Windows 更新图形运行库，保留共享纹理与硬件解码支持，并补齐旧编码中文字幕处理。\n- Android 修复播放文件句柄传递问题，验证新版 16 KB 内存页设备兼容性。\n- Linux 安装包固定媒体依赖，Apple 更新全部原生播放框架。\n- 随包提供第三方许可证、精确源码版本和重建配方；完整原生源码附件与本版本一同提供。\n- 更新界面组件与 Apple 文件选择器，保持语言按钮的无障碍标签。\n",
  "notesEn": "Updated playback on every platform.\n\n- Updates native video, audio, subtitle and secure connection components across all platforms.\n- Updates the Windows graphics runtime while retaining shared textures and hardware decoding, with legacy Chinese subtitle encoding support.\n- Fixes Android playback file descriptor handoff and verifies compatibility with 16 KB page devices.\n- Bundles reviewed Linux media dependencies and refreshes every Apple native playback framework.\n- Includes third-party notices, pinned source versions and rebuild recipes. Complete native sources accompany this release.\n- Updates design widgets and the Apple file picker while preserving the language selector’s accessibility label.\n",
